      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:1fc4jc3'
    '|a||In 2001 Akerlof shared the Nobel prize with Michael Spence and Joseph Stiglitz, for markets with asymmetric information: one side knowing more.':
