      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:10u5tee'
    '|a||So in theory hidden quality can empty a market. But look outside: used-car lots are full.':
